sequenceDiagram
%% DOC-03 — Sequence: review decision with atomic audit write (UC-05..07; CR-03, CR-08, CR-16)
    autonumber
    actor R as Reviewer
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant REV as Review service
    participant CTL as Control checks
    participant DB as Database D4, D6
    participant AUD as Audit log D9

    R->>UI: Select identity, open item
    UI->>REV: Get item detail
    REV->>DB: Load evidence, all ranked candidates, risk
    REV-->>UI: Detail view (no preselected decision)
    UI->>REV: Record detail-opened time (FR-REV-11)
    R->>UI: Choose decision and enter comment
    UI->>REV: Submit decision
    REV->>CTL: Check role, category, SoD (CR-02, CR-03), comment rule (CR-16), period not locked (CR-18)
    alt Check fails
        CTL-->>REV: Blocked, with reason
        REV->>AUD: BLOCKED_ATTEMPT event (who, what, rule)
        REV-->>UI: Decision refused, reason shown
    else Check passes
        REV->>DB: BEGIN transaction
        REV->>DB: Insert decision record (D6)
        REV->>AUD: Append event with previous hash, same transaction (FR-AUD-04)
        alt Audit write fails
            REV->>DB: ROLLBACK (CR-08)
            REV-->>UI: Error, decision not saved
        else Audit write succeeds
            REV->>DB: COMMIT
            alt Decision = escalate
                REV-->>UI: Item moved to senior queue (ESC-02)
            else Decision = approve / reject / modify / unresolved
                REV-->>UI: Item status updated, next item
            end
        end
    end
    Note over REV,AUD: Correcting a decision later inserts a new decision and a new event,<br/>earlier records are never updated (CR-09)
